  "description": "After retiring from gymnastics, Han Ji-Won thought his biggest challenges were behind him. Turns out, winning Olympic medals was easy compared to surviving university as a painfully shy ex-superstar. Enter Kwon Jung-Woo—campus heartthrob, basketball star, and a whole new world of trouble wrapped up in a perfect smile. But just when Ji-Won thinks he has Jung-Woo figured out, he discovers a surprisingly sweet side beneath that cold exterior. Can this unlikely duo overcome their differences and stick the landing on their budding romance? \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Includes nine extra chapters.*",
